                <mxCell id="nL" parent="cL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#E9D58A;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Sharp edge:&lt;/b&gt; there is no depth counter. A nested Begin() is a silent no-op, so a callee that calls Begin()+Commit() itself (the p2/p5 unguarded sites) would flush the caller&#39;s batch early. The self-wrapping helpers exist to avoid exactly that." vertex="1">
